    non-test, non-Samples project. Setting it here overrides that and the DLL lands in
    bin\Release instead of dist, where ViewLoader never sees it. CIMView/OverView/etc. all
    omit it for the same reason. Data files are deployed by CopyViewDataFiles in
    src\Directory.Build.targets - no PostBuildEvent needed.
  -->
  <PropertyGroup Condition=" '$(Configuration)|$(Platform)' == 'Release|AnyCPU' ">
    <DebugType>pdbonly</DebugType>
    <Optimize>true</Optimize>
